Components such as monitors that attach to signaling in terfaces should be designed to be phase -
independent because they are intended to mimic other real devices in the system. These
components should watch the reset signal associated with their interface and reset themselves
accordingly. A typical pattern for this is shown in the example monitor’s run_phase below.
class mon_c extends uvm_monitor;
`uvm_component_utils(mon_c)

